                                                "sense_id": "6d0a6133-b2a5-33e6-8b64-7d9f90cd8013",
                                                "text": "Imperturbability your skill, not mine / I ouch out loud and clear / Your forgiveness, like Pope's divine / I'm just an angry queer"
